'''Brittle''' is an Elemental [[Ailment]] associated with [[Cold]]. Hits against brittle enemies have up to +6% chance to [[Critical Strike|critically strike afflicted enemies]], based on the Cold Damage of the Hit that inflicted this [[ailment]], for 4 seconds.

==Mechanics==
Brittle's magnitude is given by the formula:

{{math|formula=M = 10 * ({D \over T})^{0.4} * (1 + {E \over 100})}}<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3123794 and also [[Talk:Brittle|talk page]]</ref>

where {{math|formula=M}} is the magnitude of brittle, {{math|formula=D}} is the cold damage dealt, {{math|formula=T}} is the enemy's ailment threshold, and {{math|formula=E}} is the sum of the attacker's increases to the effect of brittle (normally 0%).

By transforming the equation above, the damage needed to inflict brittle of the desired magnitude is given by the formula:

{{math|formula=D = T({M \over {10*(1 + {E \over 100})} })^{2.5} }}

To achieve the maximum magnitude, the player character needed to deal damage roughly equal to 28% of the ailment threshold, or 28% life for most monsters. These calculations do not account for increases to ailment effect.

Brittle with a base effect lower than 1% is discarded. Brittle inflicted through means other than hit damage has a base effect of +2%.

